Portions of the following file are adapted from Mathlib, and their proofs are the
work of the Mathlib authors (in particular Patrick Stevens and Bolton Bailey):

  - StructuralBertrand/Threshold.lean
      `real_threshold_inequality` and `threshold_inequality` adapt the proofs of
      `Bertrand.real_main_inequality` and `bertrand_main_inequality` from
      Mathlib.NumberTheory.Bertrand. They are prime-free size inequalities; the
      file is placed here so that the main theorem's import closure does not include
      Mathlib.NumberTheory.Bertrand.

All other files in `StructuralBertrand/` are original to this development and depend
on Mathlib only as a library.
